  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "luBDEvHlRo7MVgRWtCeR5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 272.8000183105469,
      "y": 124.50001525878906,
      "width": 1042.8592529296875,
      "height": 750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 507873144,
      "version": 1658,
      "versionNonce": 1650764372,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786549528665,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design an e-auction platform like e-bay\nFunctional Requirements:\n    1. User registration and authentication\n    2. Item listing with auction params like (start time, end time, reserve price)\n    3. Real time bidding and updates\n    4. Complete bidding lifecycle schedule -> ongoing -> ended\n    5. Payment Processing\n    6. Notifications: outbid, aution won, payment pending/completed\n    \nNon Functional Requirements:\n    1. Performance: Sub-second latency for bid placement and bid update\n    2. Scalability: Support thousands of concurrent auctions and real-time users\n    3. Security: User auth, secure payments, anti-bot protection\n    4. high availability during peak hours\n    5. Observability: logging of bids, payments, real time monitoring dashboards\n\nBack of the envelope estimations:\nUsers: 5M\nDAU: 500K\nActive Listings: 1M ongoing auctions at any moment\nBids: Avg. 10 bids/auction/day -> 10M bids/day Peak -> 30M bids/day -> 3000 RPS\npeak users: 10k concurrent users bidding on one auction -> 10k concurrent connections (websockets)\npayments: 100K completed auctions/day -> 100k payment transactions/day -> 100k/10000 -> 10 trans/sec\n\nSystem is read heavy\nWrite sensitive\nhighly secure\nreal time pressure zones\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design an e-auction platform like e-bay\nFunctional Requirements:\n    1. User registration and authentication\n    2. Item listing with auction params like (start time, end time, reserve price)\n    3. Real time bidding and updates\n    4. Complete bidding lifecycle schedule -> ongoing -> ended\n    5. Payment Processing\n    6. Notifications: outbid, aution won, payment pending/completed\n    \nNon Functional Requirements:\n    1. Performance: Sub-second latency for bid placement and bid update\n    2. Scalability: Support thousands of concurrent auctions and real-time users\n    3. Security: User auth, secure payments, anti-bot protection\n    4. high availability during peak hours\n    5. Observability: logging of bids, payments, real time monitoring dashboards\n\nBack of the envelope estimations:\nUsers: 5M\nDAU: 500K\nActive Listings: 1M ongoing auctions at any moment\nBids: Avg. 10 bids/auction/day -> 10M bids/day Peak -> 30M bids/day -> 3000 RPS\npeak users: 10k concurrent users bidding on one auction -> 10k concurrent connections (websockets)\npayments: 100K completed auctions/day -> 100k payment transactions/day -> 100k/10000 -> 10 trans/sec\n\nSystem is read heavy\nWrite sensitive\nhighly secure\nreal time pressure zones\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
