    },
    {
      "id": "zlzc2JEnTDhSJyIT4UsMS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 499.5962960644457,
      "y": 4274.066324892243,
      "width": 1453.118896484375,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fcc2d7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1005161055,
      "version": 2008,
      "versionNonce": 548470260,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785949950262,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problem Statement:\n    Design an agentic customer support system that can take actions\n    (refunds, order changes, account updates) — not just answer questions.\n\nFunctional Requirements:\n1. Process Refunds\n2. Make Order related updates\n3. Make Account Updates\n4. Should be able to handle Generic Queries\n5. Should be agentic autonomous agent working strictly on SOPs\n6. Should have guardrails to avoid double refunds (policy and order details based decision)\n7. Should be able to escalate to human for further review and approval ( refund above $25 goes for human approval)\n\nNon Functional Requirements:\n1. Fast response 2-3 secs for generic response, for refund it can take 5-6 secs (async process)\n2. High Availability of 99.9% (LLM Router to route LLM calls to various providers on failures)\n3. Less LLM Cost (complexity based LLM selection. easy query-> non reasoning model)\n\n\nEstimations:\n1. Daily Support Interactions - 50k \n2. 5% are refund requests - 2.5k/Day - 5mins/refund \n3. 5% are escalated to human - 500/Day, time per query 3mins/refund - 1500mins/day - 25hrs/day - 1 support member - 8hrs - 3-4 support members\n4. Input tokens - 20 tokens/query\n5. Output tokens - 300 tokens/query for FnQ, 3000tokens for resoning + tool calls\n6. total tokens per query - 1500-4000 tokens/query\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problem Statement:\n    Design an agentic customer support system that can take actions\n    (refunds, order changes, account updates) — not just answer questions.\n\nFunctional Requirements:\n1. Process Refunds\n2. Make Order related updates\n3. Make Account Updates\n4. Should be able to handle Generic Queries\n5. Should be agentic autonomous agent working strictly on SOPs\n6. Should have guardrails to avoid double refunds (policy and order details based decision)\n7. Should be able to escalate to human for further review and approval ( refund above $25 goes for human approval)\n\nNon Functional Requirements:\n1. Fast response 2-3 secs for generic response, for refund it can take 5-6 secs (async process)\n2. High Availability of 99.9% (LLM Router to route LLM calls to various providers on failures)\n3. Less LLM Cost (complexity based LLM selection. easy query-> non reasoning model)\n\n\nEstimations:\n1. Daily Support Interactions - 50k \n2. 5% are refund requests - 2.5k/Day - 5mins/refund \n3. 5% are escalated to human - 500/Day, time per query 3mins/refund - 1500mins/day - 25hrs/day - 1 support member - 8hrs - 3-4 support members\n4. Input tokens - 20 tokens/query\n5. Output tokens - 300 tokens/query for FnQ, 3000tokens for resoning + tool calls\n6. total tokens per query - 1500-4000 tokens/query\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
