      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Obeservability/Monitoring:\n    1. Infra level\n        a. CPU Usage\n        b. Latency\n        c. P95\n        d. Throughput\n        e. Error Rate\n    2. LLM Level (Agent)\n        a. Token Usage/Request\n        b. LLM Latency\n        c. Tool Calls\n        d. Tool Call Failuers \n        e. Workflow Duration\n        f. Escalation Rate\n    3. RAG\n        a. Faithfullness\n        b. Top-k\n        c. Citation Coverage\n        d. Similarity Score\n    4. Business\n        a. Refund rate\n        b. User Satisfaction\n        c. Query Resolution Time\n        d. User Feedback\n        e. Avg Resolution Time\n        f. Human Escalation Rate\n    5. Safety\n        a. Policy Voilation Rate\n        b. Blocked Tool Calls\n        c. Unauthorized Refund Attempts\n        d. Prompt Injection Attempts",
